{"parse": {"title": "FX-04", "pageid": 55389, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FX-03\" title=\"FX-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FX-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/FX-05\" title=\"FX-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FX</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.8F.A1.E6.89.8B.EF.BC.8C.E4.BA.A4.E6.8D.A2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"握手，交换\">握手，交换</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 握手，交换</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Giving A Hand</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>互<span class=\"color-value\"></span>帮<span class=\"color-value\"></span>互<span class=\"color-value\"></span>助<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>得<span class=\"color-value\"></span>以<span class=\"color-value\"></span>存<span class=\"color-value\"></span>续<span class=\"color-value\"></span>至<span class=\"color-value\"></span>今<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>任<span class=\"color-value\"></span>何<span class=\"color-value\"></span>现<span class=\"color-value\"></span>代<span class=\"color-value\"></span>性<span class=\"color-value\"></span>都<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>法<span class=\"color-value\"></span>抹<span class=\"color-value\"></span>杀<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>点<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191104</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>次比年轻的不同脸孔，如出一辙的面面相觑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此刻，对峙氛围不足，迷惑情绪有余。显然提问是比动手更合适的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……请问……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这儿怎么会有小孩？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……不对，你是怎么进来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“答非所问”也是一种常见的安全选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><b>《童子军手册》安全篇Ⅸ：与陌生人初次对话，应避免过快交换关键信息。</b></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……你看上去，年龄也不算大呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“泽维尔”突然变换了神色。他笑起来，看上去完全理解了一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我明白了。你是来找我的吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>你知道……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>当然。因为你没有指着我然后尖叫，“这里怎么有一根会动的香蕉！”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>香蕉？为什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>香蕉、橙子，或者别的什么。我记得那个迷障网会让强行穿越的人产生认知错乱，以为自己是某种水果。水果嘛，没有四肢，也就不会继续前进了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>总之，恭喜你穿过了迷障网，并且还是个正常神秘学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>好吧，人类标准的正常……或者别的。这也能证明你是他们送来的帮手？<br />虽然迟了点……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>不过刚好能帮上忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>好的，那……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小春雀儿抬起头望着眼前空地上的不明设施，眼神里装满了敬畏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓬勃的好奇让她很快就把要问的话忘得一干二净。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>这是……什么？这就是你的“秘密任务”吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嗯？算是吧。这是我的任务，可能也有那么点非公开性质。所以没错？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>如你所见，我正准备因地制宜地完成它～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>它看起来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>很壮观，还是很棒？我认为都是。不过还差了点东西，我正在想办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>话说回来，你怎么没穿，呃，制服？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个无心的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽管无心，却仍使女孩下意识抓紧了胸前的怀表，让冷硬的金属表面硌进掌心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>承认这一点很难，小春雀儿知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可诚实以待，对她来说也并非一种随时可变的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>我……我还不是正式的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……不是正式的成员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>哦，一个实习生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>没关系。也许在这之后，他们就会让你成为正式的编制成员呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>穿上白色的外套，变成一条聪明听话的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>什么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>算了，不重要。我知道了缺点儿什么了，来，这儿，给我搭把手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>我们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>怎么了？你难道不是来帮我的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>严格来说，我是来带你回去的，泽维尔先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……好吧。你也确实没带着防毒面罩。至于“泽维尔”——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>还是算了。你直接叫我“X”吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>抱、抱歉。我的信息，掌握得还不够全面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>你们来之前，没有看过任务详情吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>其他人还在找你。我和、我和他们走散了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>他们带了防毒面罩吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>防毒面罩？那是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>抱歉，可能因为我得到的信息有限，所以不清楚……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>对不起！如果你实在需要这个“防毒面罩”，我现在就去帮你找。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前的协助者可能正来自于当下的时代，防毒面罩则是一个对她来说尚不存在的词汇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>虽然不清楚为什么会出现这样的纰漏，但年长的孩子选择了轻轻放过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>咳——忘了它吧，我们眼下有更重要的任务，之后可不见得有这么好的机会了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>要知道，那帮老古董们向来不太乐意接纳新玩意儿～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>是的，您说得对……我有更重要的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小春雀儿深吸了一口气。显然，她也并不想错过这份难得的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她坚定地抬起头来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>先生，请跟我回去。至于“防毒面罩”，我会在之后……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“啪嗒——！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一把不知从哪个倒霉设备上拆下来的魔精毛刷，轻轻地兀自漂浮起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它平稳地向着小春雀儿飞去，停在她沾满烟尘黑迹的衣袖旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一摇摆，一晃动。绒毛从肩膀扫过袖口。所有的灰尘都从那上面消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>这是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>别管那些条条框框了，能来到这儿，已经说明你比其他人要能干得多了……漂亮地搞定这个任务，我会向他们推荐你的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像是从天而降的一根稻草。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>推荐……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩紧紧地攥住了它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>请为我下达指令！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>先帮我让这玩意儿站稳，正常运作，之后咱们再说别的问题。时间不等人，明白吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>明白！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FX-04"}}